{
  "_about": "«العربية الميسّرة»: simple, correct Arabic between Modern Standard and polite Egyptian. MSA sentence order without case endings, everyday words Egyptians already use, one action per sentence, numbers in 0-9, button names exactly as on the screen. af_guide.lint() reads this file (HELP-04, HELP-11). The banned list holds street words, technical words and stiff office words (يُرجى، نظرًا، بموجب…): the register sits between them.",
